// Settings pages are hosted inside the transparency panel instead of a property
// sheet, so each page is a flat single column: a bold section caption, then its
// controls on one aligned grid. No group box frames, no 3D look.
// Coordinates are dialog units at 96 dpi with the 9pt "Microsoft YaHei UI" font.

